**
** Management data file for use with LINGRAN model for grasland, March 2012
**
** Management type 1 - Permament grassland


** Fertiliser N application 
FERTAB  =   0.,    0.0,  !  kg N/ha
           14.,    0.0,  ! as function of day number
           15.,  120.0, 
           16.,    0.0, 
           17.,    0.0,
          120.,    0.0,
          121.,  120.0,
          122.,    0.0,
          123.,    0.0,
          365.,    0.0

** Recovery fraction of applied fertiliser N
NRFTAB  =     0.,  0.70,  !  kg N uptake by the crop per kg fertilser-N applied
             200., 0.70   !  as function of day number


* Soil N mineralization
NMINS   =    30.  !  total mineral soil N available at start of growth period [kg N/ha]
RTMINS  =   0.025  ! fraction of soil mineral coming available per day [day-1]

* irrigation water applied 
IRRTAB   =   0., 0.0,  !  irrigation water applied per day [cm]
             164.,0.0, !  as function of day number
             165.,2.0,
             166.,0.0,
             200.,0.0,
             201.,2.0,
             202.,0.0,
             220.,0.0,
             221.,2.0,
             222.,0.0,
             365.,0.0 

* Grass harvesting
CLAI  =   0.8     ! remaining leaf area index after cutting [ha ha-1]  
IMOPT =    1      ! indicates the mowing regime; 1 indicates mowing if WLVG > CWGHT,
                  ! 2 indicates mowing if mowing date and LAI > CLAI, and otherwise no mowing 

CWGHT =  1500.    !criterium weight for mowing [kg ha-1]

MNDAT=   120.,  160.0, ! dates for mowing (JUlian day)
         200.,  240.,
         280.,  320.,
         999.,  999. 